      "widgets_values": [
        "POWERED BY MINIMAX H3\n\nAuto: no active photo = Generate; one = Edit; two to nine = References.\nFor a NEW scene using just one photo, select References instead of Auto.\nUpload photos in the slots, left to right. Expand slots 4-9 when needed.\nLeave unused slots at (none), or switch enabled OFF. No placeholder image is generated.\nUse <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>, etc. Active photos are numbered in slot order; see the report.\nEdit keeps the first photo aspect ratio at edit_megapixels. Other modes use generation size/aspect.\nQuality = 50 steps, no Turbo. Developer fast = 20 steps / Turbo 0.38, Generate or Edit only.\nTwo personal H3 LoRA slots are independently OFF by default. Upload to /workspace/h3-still/models/loras.\nThis is whole-image regeneration, not protected-mask inpainting or guaranteed restoration.\n4 MP generation is a starting point. 8 MP and nine references require GPU validation.\nRequires the rebuilt H3 Still Studio image. No BF16 base weights, no AI Lab nodes, no prompt enhancer."
      ],
